WEBVTT

00:00:02.810 --> 00:00:08.840
Heroes. They are what I admired when
I was young, and what I dreamed of being.

00:00:13.240 --> 00:00:15.530
It started with an old video.

00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:19.560
He's laughing!

00:00:26.750 --> 00:00:29.750
It's fine now. Why?

00:00:34.220 --> 00:00:35.970
Because I am here.

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:40.350
Ever since I saw that one hero in the video,

00:00:40.350 --> 00:00:43.080
I started writing every day in these notebooks.

00:00:42.730 --> 00:00:44.100
"Hero Notebook"
"Izuku Midoriya"

00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:44.600
"Hero Research"
"Izuku Midoriya"

00:00:44.600 --> 00:00:49.360
"Hero Analysis for the Future"

00:00:48.560 --> 00:00:52.480
In order for me to become
a hero like him one day.

00:00:51.530 --> 00:00:57.030
"Hero Notebook"

00:01:09.210 --> 00:01:15.580
In a world where about 80% of the population
has some kind of superpower called a "Quirk,"

00:01:13.740 --> 00:01:15.720
"Superpower = Quirk"

00:01:16.120 --> 00:01:19.050
the profession that everyone
once dreamed about and admired

00:01:19.050 --> 00:01:20.640
came into the limelight.

00:01:26.810 --> 00:01:30.090
In order to deal with the
explosive increase in crime and accidents

00:01:26.940 --> 00:01:28.400
"What are villains?"

00:01:30.090 --> 00:01:32.190
that came with the appearance of Quirks,

00:01:32.170 --> 00:01:33.190
"Uncontrolled Quirk Led to Crime!?"

00:01:32.190 --> 00:01:34.610
people with courage stood up to take action--

00:01:36.090 --> 00:01:37.160
Heroes.

00:01:37.740 --> 00:01:41.710
They police the superpowers
and defend against evil.

00:01:42.280 --> 00:01:47.020
They protect us from the villains
who threaten our daily lives.

00:01:44.660 --> 00:01:47.790
"After All Might! Working
Pro Heroes interviewed"

00:01:48.440 --> 00:01:49.540
And...

00:01:53.050 --> 00:01:54.980
I am here!

00:01:56.800 --> 00:01:59.590
His name is All Might.

00:01:59.890 --> 00:02:01.580
"All Might's Super Popular!"
"All Might Gum"
"All Might's Adventure"

00:02:00.430 --> 00:02:02.750
He lives up to his title of "Number One Hero."

00:02:03.260 --> 00:02:05.660
He is the Symbol of Peace
that everyone recognizes.

00:02:03.410 --> 00:02:04.220
"All Might Curry"
"Movie in the works!"
"All Might Chips"

00:02:07.140 --> 00:02:11.280
No matter the situation, he will always
save people with a smile on his face.

00:02:12.750 --> 00:02:17.440
I admired him from the bottom of my heart.

00:02:23.950 --> 00:02:25.520
I am Izuku Midoriya.

00:02:24.850 --> 00:02:25.280
"Izuku Midoriya"

00:02:25.280 --> 00:02:27.330
"Izuku Midoriya"
"(Deku)"

00:02:28.210 --> 00:02:32.290
Right now, I am working
hard every day to become a hero.

00:02:35.300 --> 00:02:40.240
That's why what I am about
to tell you is not a sad story.

00:02:42.220 --> 00:02:43.260
But...

00:02:43.640 --> 00:02:45.350
You should probably give it up.

00:02:49.060 --> 00:02:50.890
It's unusual to see that these days,

00:02:50.890 --> 00:02:53.690
but that means he has no Quirk.

00:02:53.690 --> 00:02:57.340
That was the harsh reality that was
thrust before me at the age of four.

00:02:58.030 --> 00:03:01.810
I was Quirkless, and it dashed
my dreams of becoming a hero.

00:03:00.490 --> 00:03:02.200
"Quirkless"

00:03:02.200 --> 00:03:04.490
Deku doesn't have a Quirk.

00:03:04.490 --> 00:03:06.290
It's called being "Quirkless."

00:03:06.290 --> 00:03:07.660
That's so lame.

00:03:08.290 --> 00:03:12.420
Izuku, you really can't do anything, can you?

00:03:12.420 --> 00:03:16.380
"Izuku (Deku) Midoriya"

00:03:13.130 --> 00:03:16.380
You can read the characters
for "Izuku" as "Deku," you know.

00:03:16.380 --> 00:03:20.670
And "Deku" means someone
who can't do anything!

00:03:20.670 --> 00:03:22.130
Really?

00:03:22.130 --> 00:03:24.010
Stop that...

00:03:28.720 --> 00:03:31.340
Yes, yes, you all have wonderful Quirks!

00:03:31.340 --> 00:03:31.980
You're all...

00:03:31.980 --> 00:03:33.900
...pretty much planning
to go into the hero course, right?

00:03:33.900 --> 00:03:36.660
Oh yeah, Midoriya wanted
to go to U.A., too, right?

00:03:39.360 --> 00:03:41.890
Huh? Midoriya? No way!

00:03:41.890 --> 00:03:44.570
You can't get into the
hero course just by studying!

00:03:46.880 --> 00:03:48.540
Hey, Deku!

00:03:48.540 --> 00:03:52.160
You're below the rejects! You're Quirkless!

00:03:52.670 --> 00:03:56.040
How can you even stand
in the same ring as me?

00:03:57.020 --> 00:03:58.460
"Hero Analysis for the Future"

00:03:57.610 --> 00:03:58.460
That's mean...

00:03:59.090 --> 00:04:00.630
What?!

00:04:03.840 --> 00:04:07.680
Even so, I could not give up.

00:04:05.550 --> 00:04:08.010
"Hero Analysis for the Future"

00:04:10.180 --> 00:04:14.560
In this world, sometimes
unexpected things happen.

00:04:17.270 --> 00:04:21.030
All... Migh...

00:04:21.690 --> 00:04:25.780
Sorry 'bout getting you
caught up in my villain fighting.

00:04:25.780 --> 00:04:28.200
H-He's the real thing...

00:04:28.200 --> 00:04:32.490
He looks completely different in person!

00:04:34.370 --> 00:04:35.710
Um...

00:04:37.580 --> 00:04:40.420
Even if I don't have a Quirk,
can I become a hero?

00:04:43.630 --> 00:04:48.510
Can even someone without a Quirk be like you?

00:05:01.730 --> 00:05:05.280
Y-Y-You're deflating...!

00:05:06.740 --> 00:05:08.990
I am All Might...

00:05:10.490 --> 00:05:12.490
No way!

00:05:13.250 --> 00:05:16.750
It's an injury I got from
an enemy's attack five years ago.

00:05:17.670 --> 00:05:23.840
Right now, I can only work as
a hero for about three hours a day.

00:05:25.380 --> 00:05:28.010
Pros are always risking their lives.

00:05:28.800 --> 00:05:31.240
It's not bad to dream.

00:05:32.350 --> 00:05:36.940
But you also have to consider
what's realistic, young man.

00:05:44.070 --> 00:05:46.150
Why aren't the heroes doing anything?

00:05:46.150 --> 00:05:50.070
They can't. Apparently the villain
caught a junior high schooler.

00:05:50.070 --> 00:05:51.340
It's been like that for a while.

00:05:52.510 --> 00:05:54.040
Pathetic...

00:06:12.100 --> 00:06:14.350
Idiot! Stop!

00:06:14.350 --> 00:06:15.850
Stop!

00:06:15.850 --> 00:06:16.730
Why did I run out?

00:06:16.730 --> 00:06:18.140
What am I doing?

00:06:18.440 --> 00:06:19.720
Why?!

00:06:20.400 --> 00:06:22.020
Die in an explosion!

00:06:23.480 --> 00:06:26.570
What do I do? What do I do at a time like this?

00:06:26.360 --> 00:06:29.150
"Pre-emptive Binding Lacquered Chain Prison"
"Quickly stretch out arms (vines)
to make the opponent flinch back,
 and then use that opening to restrain them"

00:06:27.620 --> 00:06:29.150
Page 25!

00:06:30.530 --> 00:06:31.490
Take that!

00:06:40.250 --> 00:06:41.250
Kacchan!

00:06:42.250 --> 00:06:44.250
Why are <i>you</i> here?!

00:06:44.250 --> 00:06:45.710
My legs moved on their own!

00:06:45.710 --> 00:06:48.010
I don't know why, though!

00:06:50.800 --> 00:06:52.590
I think there were various reasons.

00:06:52.590 --> 00:06:54.180
--You should probably give it up.
--I'll do my best!

00:06:54.180 --> 00:06:56.890
--It's my fault...
--How can you even stand
in the same ring as me?

00:06:56.890 --> 00:06:58.390
--Kacchan!
--Unless I try...

00:06:58.390 --> 00:07:00.100
He's so cool!

00:07:00.100 --> 00:07:02.860
--But you also have to consider what's realistic...
--He saves everyone with a smile...

00:07:02.860 --> 00:07:04.650
But at that moment...

00:07:06.530 --> 00:07:10.040
You looked like you were asking for help...

00:07:12.320 --> 00:07:15.160
Stop it...!

00:07:15.770 --> 00:07:17.350
Pathetic...

00:07:18.540 --> 00:07:20.300
Pathetic!

00:07:21.000 --> 00:07:23.500
Just a little longer.

00:07:23.830 --> 00:07:25.420
Don't get in my way!

00:07:25.750 --> 00:07:28.510
He'll die in vain! Is he suicidal?!

00:07:33.960 --> 00:07:36.080
I really am pathetic.

00:07:37.770 --> 00:07:39.550
All Might...

00:07:40.770 --> 00:07:46.690
Even though I admonished you,
I wasn't putting what I said into practice!

00:07:50.460 --> 00:07:55.120
Pros are always risking their lives!

00:07:55.120 --> 00:07:57.530
All Might!

00:07:57.530 --> 00:08:01.960
Detroit Smash!

00:08:31.900 --> 00:08:34.530
Can even someone without a Quirk...

00:08:34.530 --> 00:08:36.660
...be like you?

00:08:37.530 --> 00:08:41.330
Top heroes have stories about
them from their school days.

00:08:41.330 --> 00:08:44.280
Most of their stories have one thing in common:

00:08:47.080 --> 00:08:51.260
Their bodies moved before
they had a chance to think.

00:09:01.680 --> 00:09:04.520
That was true for you, too, wasn't it?

00:09:06.770 --> 00:09:07.830
Yeah...

00:09:16.820 --> 00:09:20.160
You can become a hero.

00:09:27.620 --> 00:09:28.830
That's right.

00:09:28.830 --> 00:09:33.210
In this world, sometimes
unexpected things happen.

00:09:35.310 --> 00:09:38.300
You can become a hero.

00:09:39.010 --> 00:09:43.020
You are worthy to inherit my power.

00:09:48.270 --> 00:09:52.520
My Quirk was passed
on to me like a sacred torch.

00:09:53.570 --> 00:09:56.530
It was passed on to you...?

00:09:56.820 --> 00:10:01.370
That's right. And next, it is your turn.

00:10:01.740 --> 00:10:03.620
I'll do it!

00:10:04.160 --> 00:10:06.660
And so began my ten months of hell.

00:10:07.250 --> 00:10:09.960
Carry that to the park entrance!

00:10:09.960 --> 00:10:11.630
Put it in the truck!

00:10:11.630 --> 00:10:13.590
Let's become athletic!

00:10:20.010 --> 00:10:21.810
Go! Go!

00:10:24.680 --> 00:10:26.680
"10 months later"

00:10:35.790 --> 00:10:40.450
He finished at the last minute!
More than perfectly!

00:10:40.770 --> 00:10:43.000
Oh my... Oh my...

00:10:43.530 --> 00:10:45.240
...goodness!

00:10:46.550 --> 00:10:48.440
Take that to heart.

00:10:49.690 --> 00:10:53.460
This is power that you earned
because of your own effort.

00:10:55.130 --> 00:10:56.610
My dream became a reality.

00:10:57.210 --> 00:11:00.660
It was like a miracle from a comic book story.

00:11:01.300 --> 00:11:02.300
Eat this.

00:11:02.750 --> 00:11:03.850
Huh?

00:11:05.390 --> 00:11:08.390
The All Might that I admired
entrusted me with his Quirk.

00:11:06.810 --> 00:11:10.310
"U.A. High School Entrance Exam Location"

00:11:08.390 --> 00:11:12.020
And unbelievably, the Quirkless me,
the "decked and useless" Deku,

00:11:10.310 --> 00:11:11.350
"U.A. High School Hero Course"
"Exam Orientation"

00:11:11.350 --> 00:11:12.350
"Exam Ticket"
"Examinee No.: 2234"
"Test Location: Battle Center B"

00:11:12.480 --> 00:11:17.820
took the entrance exam for the school famous
for training heroes, U.A. High School.

00:11:17.990 --> 00:11:19.530
Are you ready?

00:11:31.750 --> 00:11:36.300
Smash...!

00:11:37.000 --> 00:11:39.840
I want to tell the four-year-old me:

00:11:40.090 --> 00:11:41.590
"You'll be fine."

00:11:43.050 --> 00:11:44.680
You both pass.

00:11:44.680 --> 00:11:51.650
"It is your fate to have all these wonderful,
life-changing things happen to you."

00:11:52.140 --> 00:11:54.400
Come, Young Midoriya.

00:11:54.600 --> 00:11:58.230
This is your hero academia!

00:12:01.570 --> 00:12:05.700
And then, my life as a
high schooler at U.A. began.

00:12:01.860 --> 00:12:05.530
"The famous school that turns out many pro heroes"
"U.A. High School"

00:12:05.700 --> 00:12:07.700
Overcome it with all you've got.

00:12:08.040 --> 00:12:11.540
This is a high school for those
who want to become pro heroes.

00:12:12.500 --> 00:12:15.920
The classes are harsh and merciless,
and everyone goes all out--

00:12:15.920 --> 00:12:17.540
Die...!

00:12:21.130 --> 00:12:24.800
I have to work a lot harder than other people!

00:12:24.800 --> 00:12:28.310
Smash...!

00:12:29.930 --> 00:12:31.180
This kid...

00:12:32.980 --> 00:12:34.720
What is the meaning of this?

00:12:35.770 --> 00:12:36.520
Hey!

00:12:37.560 --> 00:12:40.570
Kacchan hates the very sight of me, as usual,

00:12:41.190 --> 00:12:43.860
and since I was Quirkless until recently,

00:12:43.860 --> 00:12:48.460
I have to work harder
than everyone else to keep up.

00:12:59.600 --> 00:13:00.550
Deku!

00:13:01.800 --> 00:13:04.040
You are...

00:13:04.970 --> 00:13:06.180
...below me!

00:13:07.300 --> 00:13:11.770
...Smash!

00:13:13.890 --> 00:13:14.550
That's right.

00:13:15.060 --> 00:13:17.650
We didn't come here to play at being friends.

00:13:18.490 --> 00:13:20.980
But even so...

00:13:21.780 --> 00:13:22.980
Good work!

00:13:23.280 --> 00:13:24.780
You were fired up!

00:13:24.780 --> 00:13:28.280
I made some irreplaceable friends.

00:13:28.280 --> 00:13:31.160
But "Deku" sounds like the
Japanese word for "You can do it!"

00:13:31.160 --> 00:13:32.910
so I kinda like it.

00:13:35.710 --> 00:13:38.080
Friends, and friendly rivals.

00:13:44.840 --> 00:13:49.680
I took notes about everyone in
my hero notebooks as part of my research.

00:13:50.890 --> 00:13:53.640
"Katsuki Bakugo"
"Quirk: Explosion"

00:13:52.010 --> 00:13:54.450
First is my childhood friend, Kacchan.

00:13:54.930 --> 00:13:57.080
He can secrete nitroglycerin-like sweat from the palms

00:13:57.080 --> 00:13:58.770
of his hand and make it explode.

00:13:58.770 --> 00:14:00.520
He has excellent combat sense,

00:14:00.520 --> 00:14:03.030
and he passed the entrance exam in first place.

00:14:05.030 --> 00:14:07.780
"Ochaco Uraraka"
"Quirk: Zero Gravity"

00:14:06.150 --> 00:14:11.590
Uraraka can make what she touches weightless
and can make herself float, as well.

00:14:12.080 --> 00:14:14.410
The only thing is,
if she uses her Quirk too much...

00:14:16.400 --> 00:14:18.460
That's what happens, so she needs to be careful.

00:14:19.670 --> 00:14:21.790
To put it simply, Iida is a fast runner.

00:14:19.670 --> 00:14:22.170
"Tenya iida"
"Quirk: Engine"

00:14:22.460 --> 00:14:25.090
Apparently, he can increase his speed in stages.

00:14:25.840 --> 00:14:28.270
His accelerated kick is super powerful.

00:14:29.550 --> 00:14:34.260
Todoroki's Quirk lets him freeze
with his right hand and burn with his left.

00:14:29.930 --> 00:14:31.600
"Shoto Todoroki"
"Quirk: Half-Cold, Half-Hot"

00:14:35.060 --> 00:14:39.100
But up until now, he has only ever
showed us the ice from his right hand.

00:14:40.310 --> 00:14:42.020
"Tsuyu Asui"
"Quirk: Frog"

00:14:40.900 --> 00:14:46.860
Asui is good at moving fast underwater,
jumping high, and sticking to walls.

00:14:46.860 --> 00:14:49.200
She can do pretty much anything a frog can.

00:14:50.410 --> 00:14:52.070
"Minoru MIneta"
"Quirk: Pop Off"

00:14:51.030 --> 00:14:54.370
The balls on Mineta's head
stick really tight to anything.

00:14:54.790 --> 00:14:57.210
He has to be careful not to pick off
too many, or he'll start bleeding.

00:14:59.710 --> 00:15:03.130
I have a lot of other
classmates with different Quirks,

00:15:03.130 --> 00:15:05.200
and everyone is thinking about how they can

00:15:05.200 --> 00:15:08.150
use their Quirks to the best of their ability.

00:15:09.170 --> 00:15:11.050
Not just for attacking and defending--

00:15:11.930 --> 00:15:16.310
There might be lots of other ways to
use them that I can't even begin to think of.

00:15:18.980 --> 00:15:23.370
The teachers that guide us
at U.A. are also pro heroes.

00:15:25.190 --> 00:15:27.740
"Shota Aizawa"
"Quirk: Erasure"

00:15:25.610 --> 00:15:28.690
Mr. Aizawa can erase the
Quirks of those he looks at.

00:15:29.820 --> 00:15:31.950
He also has strong physical abilities,

00:15:31.950 --> 00:15:34.740
and he can use the special cloth wrapped around his neck

00:15:34.740 --> 00:15:36.990
to round up all the villains at once.

00:15:38.160 --> 00:15:44.340
And then, the number one hero, All Might,
who became a teacher at U.A. this year.

00:15:44.270 --> 00:15:47.090
"All Might"
"Quirk: One For All"

00:15:45.960 --> 00:15:51.030
His Quirk is One For All,
which can produce overwhelming power.

00:15:51.470 --> 00:15:56.270
Texas Smash!

00:15:56.270 --> 00:15:58.600
He can pull off a number
of different smash attacks.

00:15:58.600 --> 00:16:02.270
His ability to jump for long distances
is also a powerful weapon.

00:16:03.520 --> 00:16:07.860
I became the one to inherit
that Quirk of All Might's.

00:16:09.780 --> 00:16:15.280
It looks like it'll take some time for me
to be able to use that power well, though...

00:16:16.070 --> 00:16:21.010
But I'm sure I'll become a
superhero like All Might one day!

00:16:26.380 --> 00:16:30.660
...is being the "Symbol of Peace"
really that important?

00:16:31.420 --> 00:16:35.510
If I no longer am, then the
superhuman society will be seized by evil.

00:16:35.890 --> 00:16:40.350
This is the responsibility
of those of us with this power.

00:16:41.770 --> 00:16:44.650
Everyone has their own Quirks.

00:16:46.530 --> 00:16:50.260
What are all those strong Quirks for?

00:16:52.280 --> 00:16:58.240
Yes, why are we all studying at U.A.?
Why are we trying to be heroes?

00:16:59.240 --> 00:17:00.950
The real motivation behind that is--

00:17:00.950 --> 00:17:02.620
To help people.

00:17:04.050 --> 00:17:07.610
That is why we must fight villains.

00:17:08.210 --> 00:17:12.430
That was made more clear to us than we wanted.

00:17:13.550 --> 00:17:15.690
What appeared before us was

00:17:16.390 --> 00:17:17.930
an outrageous evil.

00:17:18.950 --> 00:17:20.020
Hey.

00:17:20.390 --> 00:17:22.090
What do you think'll happen...

00:17:22.680 --> 00:17:24.730
if the Symbol of Peace...

00:17:27.980 --> 00:17:30.440
...is killed by villains?

00:17:37.950 --> 00:17:38.530
"Evil"

00:17:39.030 --> 00:17:39.620
"Shock"

00:17:39.990 --> 00:17:40.490
"Fear"

00:17:44.790 --> 00:17:46.390
This is Tomura Shigaraki.

00:17:47.080 --> 00:17:49.970
He's like the head of the group calling
themselves the League of Villains.

00:17:49.710 --> 00:17:52.130
"Tomura Shigaraki"
"Leader of the League of Villains"

00:17:50.920 --> 00:17:53.600
He has a fearsome Quirk that lets him disintegrate

00:17:53.600 --> 00:17:55.570
anything he touches in an instant.

00:17:56.880 --> 00:17:59.760
"Symbol of Peace"? Ha.

00:17:59.760 --> 00:18:03.520
You're just a device to repress violence.

00:18:07.100 --> 00:18:09.770
Nomu, Kurogiri. Get him.

00:18:12.280 --> 00:18:15.390
It's true that I barely have a minute left.

00:18:15.990 --> 00:18:19.370
My power has been
declining faster than I expected.

00:18:20.130 --> 00:18:22.530
Now, let's clear this and go home.

00:18:23.580 --> 00:18:26.540
But I must do this.

00:18:27.790 --> 00:18:30.040
Why? Because I am...

00:18:32.460 --> 00:18:35.760
...the Symbol of Peace!

00:18:56.640 --> 00:18:59.110
A head-on fistfight?

00:18:59.780 --> 00:19:01.240
W-Wow...!

00:19:02.240 --> 00:19:04.410
I-I can't get near them!

00:19:05.790 --> 00:19:10.870
If your Quirk isn't shock
<i>nullification</i> but shock <i>absorption</i>,

00:19:10.870 --> 00:19:13.700
then there's a limit to it, right?

00:19:19.000 --> 00:19:21.590
Made to fight me?

00:19:21.590 --> 00:19:25.560
If you can withstand me at 100%...

00:19:26.720 --> 00:19:30.350
...then I'll force you to
surrender from beyond that!

00:19:32.350 --> 00:19:35.860
He's bleeding while giving it his all...!

00:19:37.690 --> 00:19:40.010
He's not swinging randomly.

00:19:41.110 --> 00:19:44.330
Every single hit...

00:19:45.350 --> 00:19:47.910
is more than 100% of his power!

00:19:53.760 --> 00:19:55.570
A hero...

00:19:59.730 --> 00:20:03.220
...can always break out of a tough spot!

00:20:17.570 --> 00:20:23.200
Hey villain, have you ever heard these words?

00:20:24.030 --> 00:20:25.970
Go beyond!

00:20:26.910 --> 00:20:29.040
Plus...

00:20:29.040 --> 00:20:32.460
Ultra...!

00:20:47.640 --> 00:20:53.480
Thanks to All Might and the other teachers
and students, we were able to escape.

00:20:54.480 --> 00:20:59.090
That experience made us even more resolved

00:20:59.830 --> 00:21:03.110
to gain true strength
that would not lose to evil.

00:21:06.370 --> 00:21:08.620
The villains did something dumb.

00:21:09.160 --> 00:21:10.760
This class is strong.

00:21:11.200 --> 00:21:13.100
They will become strong heroes.

00:21:13.620 --> 00:21:16.380
I am certain of that.

00:21:16.830 --> 00:21:22.510
And now, the big event that is
about to begin--the U.A. sports festival.

00:21:23.300 --> 00:21:25.660
After experiencing the fight with the villains,

00:21:25.660 --> 00:21:28.390
I'm sure everyone will be fighting even more
seriously than they have been until now.

00:21:29.470 --> 00:21:30.830
Of course, I will be, too.

00:21:31.640 --> 00:21:33.230
I will fight to win.

00:21:37.270 --> 00:21:39.110
What is a hero?

00:21:39.110 --> 00:21:40.770
What is justice?

00:21:41.570 --> 00:21:44.290
I still don't know for sure,

00:21:45.490 --> 00:21:46.700
but it's okay to fall.

00:21:47.110 --> 00:21:48.480
It's okay to cry.

00:21:49.010 --> 00:21:51.230
We will keep on moving forward.

00:21:51.830 --> 00:21:54.330
That's right. Go beyond!

00:21:54.710 --> 00:21:56.040
Plus Ultra!

00:23:30.010 --> 00:23:32.010
"Preview"

00:23:30.550 --> 00:23:34.180
The new My Hero Academia
series will finally start next time!

00:23:34.640 --> 00:23:38.140
The U.A. sports festival
that everyone will be watching!

00:23:38.140 --> 00:23:42.730
The student who wins this competition will have
doors opened on their path to being a pro hero!

00:23:42.730 --> 00:23:44.730
Because of that, everyone's giving it their all,

00:23:44.730 --> 00:23:47.740
since we all enrolled in
U.A. to become pro heroes!

00:23:47.740 --> 00:23:50.280
Yeah, I'm going to give it my all, too!

00:23:50.990 --> 00:23:53.280
Next time, "That's the Idea, Ochaco"!

00:23:53.280 --> 00:23:55.990
The reason Uraraka wants
to become a hero is revealed.

00:23:55.990 --> 00:24:01.500
"Next time: That's the Idea, Ochaco"

00:23:56.290 --> 00:23:57.690
Go beyond!

00:23:57.690 --> 00:23:59.310
Plus Ultra!
